    "Subscription/local Cancel and Escape both Keep every draft field or discard only after confirmation",
    "Local-client edit opens the selected endpoint; discard/save return to its original row and focus without adding or applying",
    "No mixed add menu; import opens backup, subscription opens its URL form, local client opens its port form",
    "No business Tabs; seven settings sections; zero stacked margins; uniform two-line rows; inline local-client status",
    "Expanded PAC icons have labels, 34px targets, keyboard focus and same-row layout; edit refills, replacement Keep/discard and delete Cancel/confirm work; save remains unapplied",
    "PAC uses shared 16/12/8 rhythm; closing settings keeps or discards its independent draft",
    "Selection is exposed with aria-pressed and does not claim applied routing",
    "Single form gutter; 12px group/8px label rhythm; invalid port rejected; Enter saves without applying",
    "Proxy dirty Escape preserves on Keep, discards on confirmation and returns focus to edit icon",
    "Proxy footer Cancel, X and Escape share dirty Keep/discard confirmation and return focus",
    "Icon rules preserve domain/scope labels; keyboard opens editor; closing settings keeps/discards draft; panel restores gear focus",
    "Long rule target retains full title and actions; rule save, delete Cancel/confirm, stale receipt clearing and surviving neighbor focus work",
    "Chinese, English and Traditional Chinese retain list/actions and add form",
    "Save and add another clears the clean draft and focuses Host; Tab follows host presets/protocol to Port, saved record exists without applying",
    "Empty panel names subscriptions/local clients; empty settings keeps one Add action, import and both source shortcuts"
